title: LSP Saving - (Example)

Check that a save in the editor reaches the running wiki, with no `reload_tiddlers`:

# Open this tiddler's `.tid` file in your editor and change the last word of this line: before
# Save. The server log says `Reloaded LSP Saving - (Example)`, and the wiki shows the new word: ask `get_tiddler` over MCP, or look in the browser after its next refresh.
# Change the `title:` field at the top of the file to `LSP Saving - (Example) renamed`, and save. The wiki now holds the renamed tiddler and not this one, and the `.tid` file is still there, holding the new title.
# Change the title back and save again.

